BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brown-bike-bus-east-20250827-0715@brownbikebus.com
DTSTAMP:20250826T150205Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20250827T071500
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20250827T074000
SUMMARY:Bike Bus East
DESCRIPTION:Both Groups: Meet 7:15 AM\, Roll out 7:22 AM.\n\nFrom the East: Meet at Snarf’s Parking Lot\, just north of W 25th Ave. & Federal Blvd. — ~1/2 mile ride to Brown (about a 10 minute ride).\n\nRider Guidelines:\n- 2nd grade and older confident riders who understand road rules (stop signs\, look both ways\, ride on the right) may be dropped off to ride with the group.\n- ECE\, Kindergarten\, and 1st grade riders should have a parent ride with them.\n- Participation indicates agreement to our terms and liability waiver.\n\nCancellations: If the ride is cancelled due to weather\, we will update the website: https://www.brownbikebus.com/\n\nMap: https://maps.app.goo.gl/5BQgLtZ7zxnZUEQD9
LOCATION:Snarf’s Parking Lot\, just north of W 25th Ave. & Federal Blvd. (https://maps.app.goo.gl/5BQgLtZ7zxnZUEQD9)
URL:https://www.brownbikebus.com/
